<form name  = "frmLtaApplication" method = "post"">
 <%@ include file="../includes/relatedlinks.jsp" %>

<body >   
<hr>
	<div class="container"> 
	<div class="row"> 
	<div class="col-xs-1 "></div>
	<div class="col-xs-10 bs-example well" style="margin-top:100px;">
	<p style="text-align:justify;margin-top:10px;font-size:18px;"> All Employees who have LTA (Leave Travel Assistance) as part of their Total Target Remuneration (TTR) sheet, will have an option to avail LTA on a monthly basis.  The Payment of Monthly LTA is Taxable and basis declaration on Timescape. The Option to avail Monthly Taxable LTA is available to employees once in a year, the intimation of which is generally circulated by HR in the month of April. In case of a New Joiner, he/she can exercise this option of availing Monthly Taxable LTA within 30 days from the Date of Joining (DOJ). <br>
	Employees not availing the Monthly LTA Option, will continue to get their LTA on an annual basis.<br></p>
	<p style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;">To apply for Monthly LTA, click on Related links.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="col-xs-1 "></div>
	</div>
